{"ts": 1791255064.2752059, "type": "step", "step": 18, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Evaluation\nI will evaluate the build using pass^k on at least 3 seeds. pass^k means the agent must succeed on all k runs, which measures reliability better than pass@k for deployment. I will report the results across three seeds and note whether performance is consistent.\n"}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255065.6042602, "type": "step", "step": 19, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "You\u2019re on the right track. For the eval section, use pass^k, not pass@k. That means: run the same setup k times on at least 3 seeds and count it as successful only if all runs succeed. In the writeup, explain that pass^k measures reliability, which is what a deployment/build needs.\n\nA simple structure:\n1) what seeds you used\n2) what counted as success/failure\n3) your pass^k results across the 3 seeds\n4) one sentence on why pass^k is the right metric here\n\nIf you want, send me your exact env definition and I\u2019ll help you tighten it up.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\n[activity] t=0 messages 4m", "t": 4, "activity": [{"t": 0, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.27095871991980863, "pass_k": 0.35535796159308425}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4740148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.0, "seen_posts": []}}
