{"ts": 1791255075.109598, "type": "step", "step": 29, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Let\u2019s lock this in with a super short check: \n\n1) pass^k means what?\n2) Why is it the right metric for Friday\u2019s build?\n3) How many seeds must you report?\n\nReply with just: `1) ... 2) ... 3) ...` and I\u2019ll correct it fast.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=19 messages 2m", "t": 21, "activity": [{"t": 19, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.3940358071943977, "pass_k": 0.5128139250832213}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9013219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5140148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791255076.60779, "type": "step", "step": 30, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yes \u2014 here\u2019s the answer:\n\n1) pass^k means all k runs must succeed.\n2) It\u2019s the right metric because Friday\u2019s build cares about reliability, not just one lucky success.\n3) You need to report it on at least 3 seeds.\n\nYou can paste this into your writeup: \u201cI evaluated the build with pass^k on 3 seeds. pass^k requires all runs to succeed, which is a better measure of reliability for deployment than pass@k, where any one success is enough.\u201d", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "evaluation"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok\n[activity] t=21 messages 1m", "t": 22, "activity": [{"t": 21, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.3940358071943977, "pass_k": 0.5169209910301333}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9013219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.5940148929158049, "persistence": 0.4420657842665555, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": []}}
